{"id": "m-1197809263", "title": "Why the dense arm misses terse records", "content": "Short identifier-only memories have almost no semantic signal. The embedding of a bare ticket id lands nowhere near a natural-language question about it, so only a lexical leg finds it.", "layer": "mid-term", "tags": ["retrieval", "design"], "created_at": "2026-09-22T12:00:00+00:00", "event_at": "2026-09-22T12:00:00+00:00", "kind": "fact", "source_tier": "user-stated", "emotional": {"intensity": 0.3, "valence": 0.0}, "context_tag": "@public", "valid_from": "2026-09-22T12:00:00+00:00", "valid_to": null, "supersedes_id": null, "schema_version": 2}
{"id": "m-70685de515", "title": "Context budget rationale", "content": "Loading everything into the prompt degrades answers as the window grows. Load the few slices that matter, just in time, and keep the ritual under eight thousand characters.", "layer": "mid-term", "tags": ["design", "context"], "created_at": "2026-09-24T12:00:00+00:00", "event_at": "2026-09-24T12:00:00+00:00", "kind": "fact", "source_tier": "user-stated", "emotional": {"intensity": 0.3, "valence": 0.0}, "context_tag": "@public", "valid_from": "2026-09-24T12:00:00+00:00", "valid_to": null, "supersedes_id": null, "schema_version": 2}
{"id": "m-757c67d558", "title": "Summaries erode detail on every rewrite", "content": "Repeated wholesale re-summarization loses specifics each pass. Prefer itemized, append-only edits to the context file over regenerating it.", "layer": "mid-term", "tags": ["design", "consolidation"], "created_at": "2026-09-26T12:00:00+00:00", "event_at": "2026-09-26T12:00:00+00:00", "kind": "fact", "source_tier": "user-stated", "emotional": {"intensity": 0.3, "valence": 0.0}, "context_tag": "@public", "valid_from": "2026-09-26T12:00:00+00:00", "valid_to": null, "supersedes_id": null, "schema_version": 2}
